{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cozy Typing Companion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your fox quietly keeps camp while you type, click, or take a break.\u00a0Your activity fills an energy meter that nudges the fox to gather wood, stoke the fire, and toast marshmallows; step away and a gentle deep-idle trickles in coins so progress never stops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954800/extras/f03f9fc827d73b318a6d6c045be4eb7c.poster.avif?t=1771805492\" width=616 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954800/extras/f03f9fc827d73b318a6d6c045be4eb7c.webm?t=1771805492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954800/extras/f03f9fc827d73b318a6d6c045be4eb7c.mp4?t=1771805492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lives on Your Desktop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A transparent, resizable window you can place anywhere.\u00a0Drag, resize, and let the fox keep you company over your work or study apps.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954800/extras/7fb258c429158e7be12b6627aa5c9b9f.poster.avif?t=1771805492\" width=616 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954800/extras/7fb258c429158e7be12b6627aa5c9b9f.webm?t=1771805492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954800/extras/7fb258c429158e7be12b6627aa5c9b9f.mp4?t=1771805492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Make It Yours</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock decoration sets with small, satisfying bonuses, then add upgrades that keep the fire thriving. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Quiet Progress, Warm Sound</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soft clinks and ember glow keep pace without pressure. No fail states, just cozy gains at your pace.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3954800?t=1771805492","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3954800?t=1771805492","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954800/318c352092d608138200d8310355aa7dd693aedb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771805492","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954800/318c352092d608138200d8310355aa7dd693aedb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771805492","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4015610,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cozy Typing Companion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your fox quietly keeps camp while you type, click, or take a break.\u00a0Your activity fills an energy meter that nudges the fox to gather wood, stoke the fire, and toast marshmallows; step away and a gentle deep-idle trickles in coins so progress never stops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954800/extras/f03f9fc827d73b318a6d6c045be4eb7c.poster.avif?t=1771805492\" width=616 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954800/extras/f03f9fc827d73b318a6d6c045be4eb7c.webm?t=1771805492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954800/extras/f03f9fc827d73b318a6d6c045be4eb7c.mp4?t=1771805492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lives on Your Desktop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A transparent, resizable window you can place anywhere.\u00a0Drag, resize, and let the fox keep you company over your work or study apps.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954800/extras/7fb258c429158e7be12b6627aa5c9b9f.poster.avif?t=1771805492\" width=616 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954800/extras/7fb258c429158e7be12b6627aa5c9b9f.webm?t=1771805492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954800/extras/7fb258c429158e7be12b6627aa5c9b9f.mp4?t=1771805492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Make It Yours</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock decoration sets with small, satisfying bonuses, then add upgrades that keep the fire thriving. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Quiet Progress, Warm Sound</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soft clinks and ember glow keep pace without pressure. No fail states, just cozy gains at your pace.</p>","developers":["Anton Weissberg"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954800/518e5942c39cce76c67570452000d40ac47dacee/header.jpg?t=1771805492","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3954800/2014170708/a5e13b204f32885d30e56b8939add51bb3716792/1762988802/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762989815","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3954800/2014170708/a5e13b204f32885d30e56b8939add51bb3716792/1762988802/dash_h264.mpd?t=17629898